{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/Header__1_.png?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/PawnAndHome__1_.gif?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world\u2019s most accurate life simulator returns\u2014kind of! This demo of <i>Walk of Life</i> throws you headfirst into the chaos so you can get a taste of things to come in the full version. Can you survive the demo version of the rat race long enough to outlive your friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/Fun___Frantic__1_.png?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out some of the base systems of Walk of Life! Will you be a fry cook, a bank manager, or simply rely on the lottery for your income? Compete against friends or the AI in a series of boardgame-inspired turns to determine who\u2019s the champion in the ultimate \u0336g\u0336a\u0336m\u0336e\u0336\u00a0 demo of life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/Express_Yourself__1_.png?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo-restricted opulence! The demo-restricted artistry! The demo-restricted swag! Decorate your demo apartment to flex your material wealth! Nothing screams \u2018success in life\u2019 like a sleek designer couch and a weaponized robot vacuum to protect it from covetous intruders! Leave your friends in awe as you transform your apartment into a veritable Shangri-La of consumer products!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will also be able to express yourself in the literal sense! But not as much as in the full game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/Avatar_Girl.gif?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/New_Ways_to_Play__1_.png?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore new ways to approach the  \u0336g\u0336a\u0336m\u0336e\u0336 demo! Take on one of many roles with vastly different playstyles and embark on not-so-epic quests to score some sweet bonus points! Are you going to climb the corporate ladder as the covetous CEO, or scrounge up valuable (and not-so-valuable) treasures as the scavenger?\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/A_Whole_New_Engine__1_.png?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brand-new engine allows for all sorts of new possibilities, including improved visuals, more fluid  \u0336g\u0336a\u0336m\u0336e\u0336 demoplay and a slew of other modern features. This cutting-edge technology will leave your eyeballs bulging from the excitement overflowing from your brain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/Coming_Soon_to_Early_Access__1_.png?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out the demo now,  because Walk of Life is coming, and you want to stay ahead of the curve! Did you want to demo some fries with that?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/CluckersClerk.gif?t=1748720341\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701960?t=1748720341","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/6f61d6503e3d16f43cceb8892eb81290e41de64f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748720341","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/a0b5521b70f6376823858eb2cc376a046c0fc7c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748720341","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/a0b5521b70f6376823858eb2cc376a046c0fc7c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748720341","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/Header__1_.png?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/PawnAndHome__1_.gif?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world\u2019s most accurate life simulator returns\u2014kind of! This demo of <i>Walk of Life</i> throws you headfirst into the chaos so you can get a taste of things to come in the full version. Can you survive the demo version of the rat race long enough to outlive your friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/Fun___Frantic__1_.png?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out some of the base systems of Walk of Life! Will you be a fry cook, a bank manager, or simply rely on the lottery for your income? Compete against friends or the AI in a series of boardgame-inspired turns to determine who\u2019s the champion in the ultimate \u0336g\u0336a\u0336m\u0336e\u0336\u00a0 demo of life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/Express_Yourself__1_.png?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo-restricted opulence! The demo-restricted artistry! The demo-restricted swag! Decorate your demo apartment to flex your material wealth! Nothing screams \u2018success in life\u2019 like a sleek designer couch and a weaponized robot vacuum to protect it from covetous intruders! Leave your friends in awe as you transform your apartment into a veritable Shangri-La of consumer products!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will also be able to express yourself in the literal sense! But not as much as in the full game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/Avatar_Girl.gif?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/New_Ways_to_Play__1_.png?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore new ways to approach the  \u0336g\u0336a\u0336m\u0336e\u0336 demo! Take on one of many roles with vastly different playstyles and embark on not-so-epic quests to score some sweet bonus points! Are you going to climb the corporate ladder as the covetous CEO, or scrounge up valuable (and not-so-valuable) treasures as the scavenger?\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/A_Whole_New_Engine__1_.png?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A brand-new engine allows for all sorts of new possibilities, including improved visuals, more fluid  \u0336g\u0336a\u0336m\u0336e\u0336 demoplay and a slew of other modern features. This cutting-edge technology will leave your eyeballs bulging from the excitement overflowing from your brain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/Coming_Soon_to_Early_Access__1_.png?t=1748720341\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out the demo now,  because Walk of Life is coming, and you want to stay ahead of the curve! Did you want to demo some fries with that?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/extras/CluckersClerk.gif?t=1748720341\" /></p>","developers":["Porcelain Fortress"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1910150","name":"Walk of Life"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701960/c90c57245d0034a48e0c4efc703a3a39132a4412/header.jpg?t=1748720341","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257148609,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148609/movie480.mp4?t=1748639931","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148609/movie_max.mp4?t=1748639931"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148609/bd3dcb93de219d31bfe62d60211bd4de272cb564/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17