bb84f89cecee1fe602bb04468/ss_29a44f4aba07f0abb84f89cecee1fe602bb04468.600x338.jpg?t=1748720341"}],"short_description":"Try the Demo for Walk of Life, a hilarious life simulator where players duke it out in the rat race of mundane living. Get a job, buy stuff, and crush your friends in local or online multiplayer. Check out the demo now and become champion in the ultimate game of life!","steam_appid":3701960,"support_info":{"email":"relax@porcelainfortress.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"demo","website":null}